From: SDSAT Forge
Subject: [PATCH] riscv: dts: spacemit: disable the optional MUSE-Card touchscreen

The headless MUSE-Card preset has no GT9xx touchscreen attached. The vendor
device tree enables it unconditionally, causing three failed I2C probes at
address 0x5d during boot.

Disable only this optional device. Keep I2C5, the touchscreen driver and the
camera configuration available; set the node back to okay when fitting a
compatible touch panel.

--- a/arch/riscv/boot/dts/spacemit/k1-x_MUSE-Card.dts
+++ b/arch/riscv/boot/dts/spacemit/k1-x_MUSE-Card.dts
@@ -279,7 +279,8 @@
 		touchscreen-max-p = <512>;
 
 		goodix,int-sync = <1>;
-		status = "okay";
+		/* Enable this node when the optional touch panel is attached. */
+		status = "disabled";
 	};
 };
 
